{
  "id": "ss.char.tri",
  "name": "Tri",
  "description": "A survivor built to run and to spit. The lightest of the eight: thin limbs, a narrow chest leaning into its own stride, and a wedge of a helmet that comes to a point the way it runs — the triangle it used to be, worn as a face. Under the jaw hangs a gland, full and glossy bile-yellow, the one thing on any survivor that still works the way the hive made it, and the whole reason it carries no other weapon: it spits. A swept crest off the back of the helmet and both feelers laid flat back along it say speed before anything else does. Same dead organ as the rest, in the same place on the chest; bare chitin cold slate, aqua plate over it. Drawn facing +x; the game flips it.",
